# --- Lecture Slides ---
# Students should see ONLY the compiled slide PDFs. Everything else in this
# folder (LaTeX sources, figures, figure-gen scripts, pptx, build artifacts)
# stays local/private. Edit & recompile the .tex in place; the resulting
# Slides_*.pdf is the only thing that gets committed.
Lecture Slides/*
!Lecture Slides/Slides_*.pdf
